cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use metrodag in your research, please cite the software."
type: software
title: "metrodag: Monotone Schematic Layouts for Directed Acyclic Graphs"
abstract: >-
  Publication-oriented causal DAG figures in R. A deterministic layered layout
  places variables and routes arrows along vertical and diagonal tracks in a
  schematic metro-map style; labels, arrowheads and station clearances are
  measured on the output device so exported figures stay legible at
  manuscript sizes.
authors:
